###Get all students
GET http://localhost:5500/api/students

###Get student by id
GET http://localhost:5500/api/students/stu-002

###Create a student
POST http://localhost:5500/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Justine Eva",
    "email": "eva@example.com",
    "englishLevel": "Advanced"
}

###Update student
PUT http://localhost:5500/api/students/stu-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
"englishLevel": "Intermediate"
}

###Delete student
DELETE http://localhost:5500/api/students/stu-001